@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+## Context
+
+`priceOrder` computes the coupon on the gross total; `Coupons.redeemable` rejects when `date >= validUntil`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Use gross total minus volume total as the coupon base; the 50% cap logic is unchanged.
+- Change the expiry comparison to `> 0`.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-coupon-base-and-expiry/proposal.md
new file mode 100644
